{"id":"ruido","lemma":"ruido","pos":"noun","rank":993,"glosses":["noise, racket, rattle, clatter, sound (various sounds, usually unwanted)","noise (unwanted part of a signal)","uproar, talk, fuss"],"ipa":"/ˈrwido/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ruidos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ruido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Muévete sin hacer ruido.","en":"Move quietly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438921"},{"text":"¿Qué son esos ruidos?","en":"What are those noises?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459596"},{"text":"Hemos oído un ruido.","en":"We heard a noise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550371"},{"text":"La máquina expendedora está haciendo unos ruidos extraños.","en":"The vending machine is making strange noises.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610721"},{"text":"¿Qué es ese ruido?","en":"What's that noise?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449823"}]}